SUMMARY:Michael Hing: How Are We Supposed To Live Like This?
DESCRIPTION:Life is increasingly insane. Nothing makes sense. Everything is
  chaos\, and we’re all just expected to keep on going? The planet is on 
 fire\, money is imaginary\, we are ruled over by a moronic class of preeni
 ng narcissists\, but every day you’re just meant to go to work and come 
 home and pretend you don’t notice that we’re being gouged at every cor
 ner and there are fewer and fewer Arnott’s shapes in every packet. Unrel
 ated to all this\, Michael Hing is developing a brand new hour of comedy.
LOCATION:Brunswick Picture House\, Brunswick Heads NSW
